THE SHORT VERSION
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Individuals use it free. Companies pay. That is the whole idea.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. FREE USE - who may use the Software at no charge
------------------------------------------------------------------------
You may download, install, run, study and modify the Software, free of
charge, if you are using it as:

  (a) an individual, for personal projects, learning or experimentation;
  (b) a solo builder or a team of up to two people, in a project that earns
      under GBP 10,000 a year in total (revenue, not profit), including
      side projects you hope will one day earn more;
  (c) a student, teacher or researcher, for study, teaching or published
      research, at any institution;
  (d) a registered charity or nonprofit, for its own work;
  (e) anyone, to evaluate the Software before deciding to buy a licence,
      for as long as the evaluation honestly takes.

Under free use you may change the code for your own purposes. You may not
publish or distribute your changed version (see section 3). Improvements
you want to share go back to the project as contributions (section 6).

------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. COMMERCIAL USE - who must hold a paid licence
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Any use outside section 1 is commercial use and requires a written
commercial licence from Aetherion Substrata Ltd before it starts. This
includes, without limitation:

  (a) use inside a company, partnership or other organisation with more
      than two people, whether or not the use is internal;
  (b) use in a product, service, tool or process that earns, or is part of
      something that earns, GBP 10,000 or more a year;
  (c) use by, or on behalf of, a client or customer;
  (d) shipping the Software, changed or unchanged, inside anything you sell,
      license, host or otherwise provide to others.

If you grow out of section 1, you have 60 days from crossing the line to
take out a commercial licence. Nobody is punished for succeeding; you just
start paying when it starts paying you.

Terms and prices are in COMMERCIAL.md next to this file.

